    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lynam Auctioneers are delighted to present No. 34 Acorn Road, a substantial three-bedroom family home with outstanding kerb appeal, ideally situated in one of Dundrum's most sought-after residential locations.\r\n\r\nThis impressive home is beautifully presented externally, featuring a private driveway to the front and an exceptionally long, sun-drenched south-facing rear garden—a truly outstanding feature that sets this property apart. Rarely does a home offer such an expansive outdoor space, providing endless possibilities for family enjoyment, entertaining, and future enhancement.\r\n\r\nThe magnificent rear garden also presents tremendous potential to extend to both the side and rear (subject to the necessary planning permission), while still retaining a generous private garden, making it an ideal opportunity for those seeking to create their forever family home.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned on the ever-popular Acorn Road, No. 34 enjoys a mature and well-established setting with an abundance of amenities on its doorstep, including excellent schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, parks, and superb transport links. Combining an exceptional site, enormous potential, and a highly desirable location, this is a rare opportunity to acquire a home that can be enjoyed for years to come while offering exciting scope for future expansion.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 1950's to an exceptional standard the accommodation will suit the vast majority of family requirements.  On the right as you enter the property there is the shower room , to the left is the living room and at the rear a separate dining room and kitchen. Upstairs there are three double bedrooms, and a family bathroom.  \r\n\r\nSituated off Barton Road, close to Dundrum, Churchtown and Nutgrove. The property benefits from its ease of access to a wide range of outdoor pursuits, local shops and restaurants. Recreational amenities include Marlay Park, Meadowbrook Swimming Pool as well as lots of sporting facilities for children. There is also an excellent schooling service in the locality. The area is well served by public transport, the LUAS is within walking distance and it is within comfortable commuting distance to M50/N11 road networks.\r\n\r\nViewing is a must, please reply to ADVERT to arrange an appointment with our Sales Team.\r\n\r\n--------------------------------------\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser.\r\n\r\n--------------------------------------"
      },
